Important Interview Points

1.

Always write the base case first.

if(root == NULL)
    return;

----------------------------------------------------

2.

Pass vector by reference.

vector<int>& ans

----------------------------------------------------

3.

Preorder means visit the root before recursive calls.

----------------------------------------------------

4.

Each node is visited exactly once.

Time Complexity = O(n)

----------------------------------------------------

5.

Recursive stack space depends on the height of the tree.

----------------------------------------------------

Pattern Recognition

If the question says

"Visit Root before children"

↓

Think

